Message Filters Plugin
======================

ABOUT PLUGIN
------------
This plugin automatically sorts incoming email in your INBOX into specific folders 
based on user-configured criteria (e.g. Sender, Recipient, Subject, Headers, or Body).
Filter rules are executed both in real-time during webmail navigation and in the 
background via the cron job (`plugins/ai_agent/cron.php`).

SPAM FILTERING NOTE
-------------------
The legacy, obsolete DNSBL (DNS-based Blackhole List) spam filter code from 2001 has 
been deprecated and removed. DNSBL lookups were slow, queried obsolete services, and 
have been completely replaced by the modern AI-assisted Spam Protection system 
(`plugins/spam_buttons` and `plugins/ai_agent`), which features Bayesian and Gemini AI 
learning, sender reputation scoring, and unified blacklist/whitelist controls.

CONFIGURATION
-------------
Plugin configuration can be set via `plugins/filters/config_default.php` or overridden 
in `config/filters_config.php`.

- $UseSeparateImapConnection: Set to true if your IMAP server requires a distinct 
  connection for filter moves. Default: false.
